@SmartRestaurant_HostAddress = https://localhost:7031

### GET All Staff
GET {{SmartRestaurant_HostAddress}}/api/admin/staff
Accept: application/json

### CREATE New Staff
POST {{SmartRestaurant_HostAddress}}/api/admin/staff
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "test_staff_1",
    "password": "password123",
    "fullname": "Nguyễn Văn A"
}

### UPDATE Staff (id=1)
PUT {{SmartRestaurant_HostAddress}}/api/admin/staff/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fullname": "Nguyễn Văn A - Updated",
    "isActive": true
}

### DELETE Staff (id=1)
DELETE {{SmartRestaurant_HostAddress}}/api/admin/staff/1

